ivre"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Rosa has a restaurant in Lisbon.","ans":"T","why":"“in Lisbon.”"},{"q":"Rosa has a lot of free time.","ans":"F","why":"“doesn’t have much.”"},{"q":"She has three cookbooks.","ans":"T","why":"“three cookbooks.”"},{"q":"Rosa has a daughter.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“assistant” means…","opts":["assistente","chefe","cliente"],"ans":0,"why":"assistant = assistente."},{"q":"“farm” means…","opts":["fazenda","floresta","praia"],"ans":0,"why":"farm = fazenda."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Have / have got: practice","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pergunta","Resposta"],"rows":[["**Has she got a TV show?**","**Yes, she has.**"],["**Does she have free time?**","**No, she doesn’t.**"],["**Have they got a farm?**","**Yes, they have.**"]],"cap":"Respostas curtas"},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Não misture: *Do you have got…?* ✗ → *Have you got…?* ✓ ou *Do you have…?* ✓"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She ___ two assistants. (have)","a":"has","why":"she → has."},{"s":"___ she have free time? (do/does)","a":"Does","why":"she → Does."},{"s":"They ___ got a farm.","a":"have","why":"they → have."},{"s":"She ___ have much time.","a":"doesn’t","why":"she → doesn’t."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["assistant","assistente"],["farm","fazenda"],["cookbook","livro de receitas"],["bill","conta"],["show","programa"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["have","two","I"],"ans":"I have two","pt":"Tenho dois."},{"words":["don't","No","I"],"ans":"No I don't","pt":"Não."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"assistant","pos":"noun","pt":"assistente","ex":"A good assistant.","