"model":"I don’t have much time."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line biography of a famous cook or friend.","model":"Rosa has a restaurant. She has got two assistants. She has three cookbooks. She doesn’t have free time. Her family has a farm. She loves her job.","checklist":["Usei **has / has got**","Usei **uma negativa**","Usei **3 fatos**"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “assistant” mean?","opts":["assistente","fazenda","conta"],"ans":0,"why":"**assistant** = assistente."},{"q":"What does “farm” mean?","opts":["livro de receitas","fazenda","programa"],"ans":1,"why":"**farm** = fazenda."},{"q":"What does “cookbook” mean?","opts":["conta","norte","livro de receitas"],"ans":2,"why":"**cookbook** = livro de receitas."},{"q":"What does “bill” mean?","opts":["conta","programa","gorjeta"],"ans":0,"why":"**bill** = conta."},{"q":"“Has she got a TV show?” — short answer","opts":["Yes, she has.","Yes, she does.","Yes, she have."],"ans":0,"why":"Has → has."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Em **Reading**, biografias trazem dados (datas, lugares).","Em **Writing**, escreva fatos na ordem cronológica."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Peça uma **mini-biografia** de um colega.","Treine **respostas curtas**.","Erro típico: *“Do you have got?”* → *Have you got?*"]}]}]}